Package: dev-wallpaper
Version: 1.0.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pil, fonts-dejavu-mono | fonts-dejavu-core, libglib2.0-bin, systemd, bash
Recommends: zenity
Maintainer: Bhavin Vaghadiya <vaghadiyabhavin61@gmail.com>
Description: Developer-themed still or animated wallpapers for GNOME
 Generates code-editor wallpapers with syntax-highlighted snippets (PHP,
 Laravel, JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust, Bash, SQL) in popular color themes,
 and rotates to a new design on a timer. The animated mode types the code out
 line by line using a GNOME slideshow, so no video player runs in the
 background. Run "dev-wallpaper-setup" or open "Developer Wallpaper" from the
 app menu to configure it.
